## Explicit Memory Context
Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I want to file my 2024 taxes correctly. I'm head of household in Boston MA. W-2 from Desert Sun Logistics: $91,000. Additional income: $12,500 (consul..."

